1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,320
Thousands of zombies

2
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:02,610
are staring at his light.

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:04,030
How do you turn off

4
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,750
a lamp that won't turn off?

5
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,830
The override is locked.

6
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,170
The key is gone.

7
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,540
He finds the breaker box.

8
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:12,560
One click.

9
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,610
The lamp dies.

10
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,300
The island goes dark.

11
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,560
The radio dies too.

12
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:19,680
And the radar.

13
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,210
He can't see the shore anymore.

14
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:22,810
The longest night

15
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:23,840
of his life.

16
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,700
Then, before dawn,

17
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,520
the waves go quiet.

18
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,720
The tide is dropping.

19
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:31,820
Fast.

20
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,320
And a line of pale sand rises,

21
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:36,090
straight to the island.

22
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:37,840
A causeway.

23
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,160
Forty feet wide.

24
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,370
Ankle deep.

25
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:43,050
Zombies can't swim.

26
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,880
But they can walk.

27
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,960
Rule number one just broke.

28
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,210
Low tide is at five forty-seven.

29
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,470
Two hours away.

30
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:52,770
The first one steps

31
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,980
onto the sand.

32
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:59,530
Part three. The wall has a door. Follow for part three.
